Go, go.

1506
01:42:01.961 --> 01:42:03.292
Uh...

1507
01:42:03.463 --> 01:42:07.399
I didn't. She invited me
to her apartment for dinner.

1508
01:42:07.567 --> 01:42:09.057
<i>Did you bring anything?</i>

1509
01:42:10.804 --> 01:42:12.533
<i><font color="#808080">FERRIS:</font>
I did.</i>

1510
01:42:13.339 --> 01:42:16.103
A dessert pastry.

1511
01:42:16.276 --> 01:42:19.370
<i>If you want to see Miss Aisha,
you must go where I say.</i>

1512
01:42:20.013 --> 01:42:23.972
<i>Trade you for her.
No trick or Miss Aisha will die.</i>

1513
01:42:24.150 --> 01:42:25.742
Tell me where I'm to go.

1514
01:42:26.219 --> 01:42:27.777
<i><font color="#808080">MAN:</font>
I'll tell you where to go.</i>

1515
01:42:27.954 --> 01:42:30.889
<i>It is near the border.
Highway 15.</i>

1516
01:42:31.057 --> 01:42:34.083
<i>Between Al-Saidi and Mahbrouk.</i>

1517
01:42:34.260 --> 01:42:36.091
<i>That's where you go. Bye.</i>

1518
01:42:49.776 --> 01:42:52.404
<font color="#D900D9">(DANCE MUSIC PLAYING ON RADIO)</font>

1519
01:43:08.061 --> 01:43:10.052
